{/* ── 7 · THE DASHBOARD ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    New, and the reason this band exists at all: a drop is bought partly on the
    strength of what happens after it is ordered, and nothing on the site said
    what that was. Two screens, one of them the client's.
    The two media slots are PLACEHOLDERS, deliberately and visibly — the
    screenshots do not exist yet and a neutral rectangle pretending otherwise
    is how a slot stays empty forever. Every other image on this page is real. */}
<section class="band well-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="statement">
      <h2>{c.dashH[0]} <em class="hv-accent">{c.dashH[1]}</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">{c.dashLede}</p>
